Cause (confirmed via `mvn dependency:tree`): OpenSearch's own POM brings
org.apache.logging.log4j:log4j-api and log4j-jul as transitive
dependencies, but NOT log4j-core (the actual logging implementation) --
unlike Elasticsearch's equivalent bundle, which does. Fixed by adding
log4j-core:2.21.0 (matching the resolved log4j-api version) explicitly
to opensearch-direct-bench/pom.xml.
